Third-party artwork
-------------------

The application icon, installer artwork, splash mark, Start Center mark,
and About mark use the "description" glyph from Google Material Design
Icons:

  Upstream:  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
  Commit:    10ecc14790612ca8fd164e3f4ffe9c16fc50d5b7
  Copyright: Google LLC and Material Design Icons contributors
  License:   Apache License 2.0

The icon path geometry is used unchanged. This project only rasterizes it
and applies the product fill color. A copy of the license is shipped in
app/branding/third-party/material-design-icons/LICENSE.

